{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"理查德·费曼·代表成就","stage":"DONE","category":"richard-feynman","categoryLabel":"理查德·费曼","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.75,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/31_richard-feynman/4_major-works","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"理查德-费曼的代表成就\">理查德·费曼的代表成就</h1><p>本卷以「作品」为线索，盘点费曼留下的标志性著作与成果。它们横跨硬核的科学论文、传世的教科书与风靡全球的科普回忆录，共同展现了一个既深刻又亲民的费曼。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷的分工\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷的分工</h2><p>费曼人物 hub 共六卷，各有侧重。本卷（第四卷）只谈<strong>作品本身</strong>——它的成书背景、结构、内容与历史接受；不展开作品背后的物理思想或人生轨迹，那些在兄弟卷里：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n<th>与本卷的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1 生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>人生轨迹</td>\n<td>本卷不复述生平，只在必要处带出成书背景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">2 核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>物理思想（费曼图、路径积分等）</td>\n<td>本卷谈承载这些思想的<strong>论文与书</strong>，思想本身看第二卷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3 思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>思维方式（用图像思考、不自欺等）</td>\n<td>本卷的作品是这些方法的<strong>产物与例证</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5 影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>作品造成的<strong>后世效应</strong></td>\n<td>本卷谈作品是什么，第五卷谈它改变了什么</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6 争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>评价与争议</td>\n<td>本卷对人设/史实的辨析点到为止</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>第二、三卷讲「思想」，本卷讲「装着思想的作品」，第五卷讲「作品的回响」。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"三章结构与推荐学习路径\">三章结构与推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;第一章 科学著作&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;第二章 费曼物理学讲义&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;第三章 科普与回忆录&quot;]&#10;    A -.最硬核.-&gt; A&#10;    C -.最亲民.-&gt; C\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"第一章 科学著作\"] --&gt; B[\"第二章 费曼物理学讲义\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"第三章 科普与回忆录\"]\n    A -.最硬核.-&gt; A\n    C -.最亲民.-&gt; C</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 科学著作</strong>：从奠定 QED 的 <a href=\"scientific-works/qed-papers-and-theory-of-fundamental-processes\">专业论文</a>，到面向大众讲 QED 的小书 <a href=\"scientific-works/qed-the-strange-theory-of-light-and-matter\">《光与物质的奇异理论》</a>。展示同一理论在「最专业」与「最通俗」两端的表达。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 费曼物理学讲义</strong>：<a href=\"the-feynman-lectures/the-feynman-lectures-on-physics\">这部教科书</a> 如何成为物理学习者的圣典，以及背后 <a href=\"the-feynman-lectures/teaching-as-a-craft\">把教学当手艺</a> 的哲学。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 科普与回忆录</strong>：<a href=\"popular-and-memoirs/surely-youre-joking-and-memoirs\">《别闹了，费曼先生！》</a> 塑造的文化偶像，与严肃的 <a href=\"popular-and-memoirs/the-character-of-physical-law\">《物理定律的本性》</a> 对科学之美的礼赞。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>前置建议</strong>：若想读懂第一章的论文篇，先浏览第二卷的 <a href=\"../core-contributions/qed-and-diagrams/feynman-diagrams\">费曼图</a> 会更顺。<strong>按难度由浅入深</strong>的读法则相反：从第三章的回忆录入门 → 第二章感受教学 → 第一章啃硬核。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一条主线\">一条主线</h2><p>通过梳理这些作品，本卷力图说明：费曼的伟大不仅在于他发现了什么，也在于他以何等清晰、生动而充满魅力的方式，把科学传递给了同行与大众——从 1949 年《物理评论》上的论文，到 1985 年面向外行的小书，贯穿其中的是同一种「真懂就讲得清」的信念。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scientific-works","title":"科学著作","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/major-works/scientific-works","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"qed-papers-and-theory-of-fundamental-processes","title":"量子电动力学论文","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/major-works/scientific-works/qed-papers-and-theory-of-fundamental-processes"},{"seq":2,"slug":"qed-the-strange-theory-of-light-and-matter","title":"《QED：光与物质的奇异理论》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/major-works/scientific-works/qed-the-strange-theory-of-light-and-matter"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-feynman-lectures","title":"费曼物理学讲义","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/major-works/the-feynman-lectures","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-feynman-lectures-on-physics","title":"《费曼物理学讲义》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/major-works/the-feynman-lectures/the-feynman-lectures-on-physics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"teaching-as-a-craft","title":"把教学当作一门手艺","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/major-works/the-feynman-lectures/teaching-as-a-craft"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"popular-and-memoirs","title":"科普与回忆录","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/major-works/popular-and-memoirs","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"surely-youre-joking-and-memoirs","title":"《别闹了，费曼先生！》与回忆录","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/major-works/popular-and-memoirs/surely-youre-joking-and-memoirs"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-character-of-physical-law","title":"《物理定律的本性》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/major-works/popular-and-memoirs/the-character-of-physical-law"}]}]}